  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 2.0.0:\n      - Starts the v2 secure governance lane with the new AstraFlow.Security package.\n      - Adds shared sensitive-name taxonomy and redaction policy primitives for diagnostics, CLI, observability, analyzers, and integrations.\n      - Wires OpenTelemetry redaction and convention mapping sensitive-name defaults to the shared policy.\n      - Adds security policy tests and release verification coverage for the new package.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
